{"id":1477980,"shortDescription":"Freud’s Bones quiere rendir homenaje al la psicoanálisis y a su fundador S. Freud. Sumérgete en la mente di Freud, descubre el misterio detrás de su crisis. Investiga artefactos egipcios perturbadores, rompecabezas filosóficos y desórdenes sexuales perversos en una aventura indie sin precedentes.","developers":["Katabasi Studio","Fortuna Imperatore"],"publishers":["Fortuna Imperatore AxelFox","Katabasi Studio"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"25 MAY 2022","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738848676","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477980/ss_d107f3e6088de438289d7d3a2895ca692ad018af.600x338.jpg?t=1738848676","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477980/ss_d107f3e6088de438289d7d3a2895ca692ad018af.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738848676"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477980/ss_e1da4adf0a4867448507b70d0d3d511ae611fb4e.600x338.jpg?t=1738848676","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477980/ss_e1da4adf0a4867448507b70d0d3d511ae611fb4e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738848676"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477980/ss_2a75937b04d6378d0c0cb24b58dfeeb742035bef.600x338.jpg?t=1738848676","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477980/ss_2a75937b04d6378d0c0cb24b58dfeeb742035bef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738848676"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477980/ss_d4cd9b1c9146f08cacf0b986accc464304669c9d.600x338.jpg?t=1738848676","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477980/ss_d4cd9b1c9146f08cacf0b986accc464304669c9d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738848676"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps